why: Kirill asked why the block said "returns false" and not that the function rejects a posting that does not declare the currency; the act is said by what it does to the domain's thing, and a return value only where the value is the point Rescored 2026-09-29 under §94: subject and phrasing keeps dropped, so its column no longer compares.
labelled: 2026-09-28
--- code
export function keepsPosting(posting: Posting, currency: string): boolean {
  return !isPostingEntry(posting) || declaresCurrency(posting, currency);
}
--- facts
A ledger export may list a posting with no currency, and the clearing house cannot settle such a posting.
